_meanings:
want of symmetry or regularity, the breaking of arrangement,
 regarded as a fault of composition. (It is the same as {#BagnaprakramatA#}
 mentioned in <ls>K. P. 7</ls>), the break of symmetry being either in expression
 or construction; {#nATe niSAyA niyaterniyogAdastaM gate hanta niSApi yAtA#}
 is an instance of the former, where {#gatA niSApi#} would relieve the
 irregularity of expression; and {#viSrabDaM kriyatAM varAhatatiBirmustAkzatiH#}
 {#palvale#} is an instance of the latter, where the symmetry of the verse
 requires the active instead of the passive construction, and the fault
 may be removed by reading the line as {#viSrabDA racayantu SUkaravarA#}
 {#mustAkzatiM palvale#}; see <ls>K. P. 7</ls> under {#BagnaprakramatA#} for further details.
